00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,437
To tell which is which: the second derivative.

2
00:00:03,437 --> 00:00:07,148
Negative means the curve bends down, so a maximum.

3
00:00:07,148 --> 00:00:09,635
Positive bends up: a minimum.

4
00:00:09,635 --> 00:00:14,817
Zero: the test fails, and you must check whether f dash changes sign.

